Definitions

"Host Software" means the FreeForGemPear source code published in this
repository (the host program, scripts, HiveOS and Windows packaging and
documentation) and any work derived from it.

"GPU Library" means the prebuilt libpearlgpu.so / pearlgpu.dll / pearlgpu.lib
files and the GPU kernels contained in them. The GPU Library is distributed in
binary form only.

"Software" means the Host Software and the GPU Library together.

"Dev Fee" means the mechanism in the Software that directs a share of mining
time (1% in the original release) to the developer's wallet, including its
rate, schedule, wallet address and the code that implements it
(host/src/devfee.rs and the code that calls it).

